1RUNCTRL IMMEDIATE-HALT      N01CRITICAL ANOMALY - MANUAL CONTROL ROOM APPROVAL REQUIRED   
1DATAOPS QUARANTINE-BATCH    N02CRITICAL DATA ANOMALY - QUARANTINE AND INVESTIGATE          
2RUNCTRL CONTROL-REVIEW      N03ELEVATED ANOMALY - CONTROL REVIEW BEFORE NEXT CYCLE         
2DATAOPS REFERENCE-REFRESH   Y04MODERATE ANOMALY - AUTO REFRESH REF DATA AND RERUN CHECKS   
3DATAOPS MONITOR-ONLY        Y05LOW RISK SIGNAL - KEEP MONITORING                             
